{#
    Item Meta Description -- the meta description of an item detail page.

    Cuts the item's own text the way a CMS page excerpt is cut - tags stripped, whitespace collapsed, a word
    boundary before CmsService::DESCRIPTION_LENGTH - so every item type describes itself alike. Without text it
    prints the line the caller built from the item's fields.

    Used in:    books / films / boardgames / dishes detail pages
    Parameters:
        - text (string, optional)     -- the item's own description; default: none
        - fallback (string, required) -- the line naming the item, printed when text is empty
#}
{%- set plain = (text|default('')|replace({'<': ' <'})|striptags|u).collapseWhitespace() -%}
{{- plain.isEmpty() ? fallback : plain.truncate(constant('App\\Service\\Cms\\CmsService::DESCRIPTION_LENGTH'), '…', constant('Symfony\\Component\\String\\TruncateMode::WordBefore')) -}}
